          </a>

          <a href="/downloads/what-after-pu/emerging-interdisciplinary-what-after-pu.pdf" target="_blank" class="stream-download-card" style="display: block; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; background: #fff;">
            <h4 style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Emerging Tech & Interdisciplinary</h4>
